frame: map needs a drawn diagram with a message tied to a stop; without one,
the bundle keeps the pick and names the problem, and the reader opens Brief.
-- base/a.go --
package a
-- review.md --
---
frame: map
---
# Map without stops

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  a->>b: calls B
```
